  "source_declaration": "ChainComplex.Koszul.topExtScalarExtension_isLocalizedModule",
  "scope": "For a localization A of a commutative ring R at T, the actual exact functor map on Ext from ModuleCat R to ModuleCat A is IsLocalizedModule T for a Koszul-regular finite quotient in top degree. Includes length zero, arbitrary coefficients, and independent HasExt sizes. Rings and module carriers share universe u as in the source.",
  "upstream_audit": [
    "Pinned Mathlib lacks the newer Ext.MapAdjunction module used by the source. Stacks.ExtAdjunction.extMap and extMap_bijective are reused instead; only the linear bundling and its unit triangle identity are added. No adjunction bijection proof is copied.",
    "StacksFrontier.Homology.ExtendScalars.Flat already supplies native extension additivity and flat preservation of finite limits for the needed universes. Finite colimits follow from the native adjunction; no duplicate exactness lemma is added.",
    "Mathlib scalar-extension adjunction, scalar actions, tensor localization instance, EnoughInjectives for modules, mapExtLinearMap and IsLocalizedModule.of_linearEquiv are reused directly.",
    "A direct pure-tensor proof establishes base-ring linearity, avoiding the old auxiliary scalar-extension/tensor-product comparison model."
  ],
  "declarations": [
    "ModuleCat.Algebra.extendScalars_linear",
    "ModuleCat.extendRestrictScalarsAdj_unit_isLocalizedModule",
    "Stacks.ExtAdjunction.extMapLinear",
    "Stacks.ExtAdjunction.extMapLinear_apply",
    "Stacks.ExtAdjunction.extMapLinear_comp_unit",
    "Stacks.ExtAdjunction.extMapLinearEquiv",
    "Koszul.seqTopExtScalarExtension_isLocalizedModule"
  ],
  "chosen_model": "Actual ModuleCat.extendScalars(algebraMap R A), its actual adjunction unit and existing Stacks extMap; native Koszul top Ext coefficient localization is composed with the existing bijective adjunction map upgraded to a linear equivalence. Target is Ext_A(F(R/I),F(N)), not merely Ext_R(R/I,G(F(N))).",
  "limits": [
    "This layer stops at F(R/I); COL-0166 supplies its actual quotient identification.",
    "This layer does not normalize the target cocycle; COL-0167 supplies native target normalization.",
    "Old named Aglib principal class comparison remains pending. No legacy environment or cache is restored.",
    "No new Ext, resolution, scalar-action or localization model. No kernel replay or push. Shared integration belongs to the parent."
  ],
